{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-aark-residences","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"aark-residences-aark-developers-dubailand","about":"Aark Residences is an 11-storey residential building by Deca. The facade and interior design combine modernity and aesthetics of nature. The complex offers its residents carefully designed 1 and 2 bedroom apartments. The interiors use a light color scheme, and the layouts of the residences are characterized by functionality and attention to every detail. Elegant design, modern technology and premium amenities combine to create a tranquil and cozy atmosphere, while the residences offer panoramic views of the cityscape.Residents are presented with a host of world-class amenities, including a gym, swimming pool, children's playground, shaded lounge for outdoor activities, lobby, and a green park with seating and barbecue areas. The complex is under 24-hour security and video surveillance.There are many shopping outlets within walking distance of the complex. There are many schools nearby Aark Residences, including Aquila School 0.2 km away and GEMS First Point School 0.6 km away. There are also many socially necessary facilities such as beauty salons, pharmacies, cafes and restaurants within walking distance.Aark Residences is well connected to the main thoroughfares of the city. Located just 20 minutes from Burj Khalifa, 5 minutes from Dubai Outlet Mall and just 20 minutes from Dubai International Airport.","price":931935,"title":"Aark Residences","bitrix":{"id":937,"pf_id":"are.2.13246","source":null,"project_id":"Aark Residences","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Aark Residences","property_type":"Villas","developer_name":"Aark Developers","project_location":"Dubai Land Residence Complex"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/545/images/2023/11/24/340x252/eD5D1qxfYfdG0aRRl8aMWccOZSWjPYgVuuUIYzGI.webp","464x